From fd5c36a6aa68d785e5c0aaabd210053760c61a9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:23:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wininet: Cache connectivity until network state changes.

Watch address, route and interface changes through NSI. Reuse unchanged
connectivity results and query directly when monitoring is unavailable.

Imported without changes from nanomatters/wine-salkim (Wineland), commit
fd5c36a6aa68d785e5c0aaabd210053760c61a9d
https://github.com/nanomatters/wine-salkim/commit/fd5c36a6aa68d785e5c0aaabd210053760c61a9d
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, the same as Wine. Author: Erhan Bilgili.
Wine bug: https://bugs.winehq.org/show_bug.cgi?id=60465
---
 dlls/wininet/Makefile.in    |   5 +-
 dlls/wininet/connectivity.c | 203 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/wininet/internet.c     |  46 +-------
 dlls/wininet/internet.h     |   2 +
 4 files changed, 213 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 dlls/wininet/connectivity.c

